            <ArticleTitle>Prevalence of asthma in urban school children in Jaipur, Rajasthan.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>835-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A cross sectional survey of 3321 school going children (5-15 years) using modified ISAAC questionnaire in Jaipur city showed 7.59% children to have asthma (in last 12 months) and 8.4% wheezing in last 12 months. Only 5.3% children had physician diagnosed asthma ever suggesting under diagnoses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
